{"v":4,"catch":"讓我們朝著目標大躍進吧！","desc":"《HIGHWAY RACE》是TAITO於1983年推出的一款賽車遊戲。跑完每條賽道，同時避開障礙物和其他車輛。 目標是在課程結束時向對岸大跳並用降落傘安全著陸。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-02-24","genres":["競速","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0f5af67377bec0dd124fdd9851d2911072fe42e6469f02f3f39e3484e58523a4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1b9c074b63ec26d7e3795f037e19b32c9e37fb1ed0facf266f5ebac6eb92cbf0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a94257821ad32d22f747c61d58cb53016403d2f89858fc8ecff121f66de0464e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/873e9200c2a9ae6f69a5a69b137a35c93a2dc9b0390c8100f034860231f68b0b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0898fcd813d6351526de607b3154a9834f82a43cd6704486ae5665a5cd25fea2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/480b9e1361a1017415321c27ebae4edb19aafc62961358e3e13331f70755eb82.jpg"],"titleId":"0100bf9016c28000","dlc":[]}